; matrix case M-control-110: RAM:ev/asciitable/asciitable under EmuV0 110, from a fresh boot
Failat 30
Echo >RESULTS:M-control-110.txt "run M-control-110"
Version C:EmuV0 FULL >>RESULTS:M-control-110.txt
Echo "== LIBSV0" >>RESULTS:M-control-110.txt
List LIBSV0: FILES LFORMAT="%n %l" >>RESULTS:M-control-110.txt
Copy C:EmuV0 RESULTS:emuv0-110.bin
Echo "== starting emulator" >>RESULTS:M-control-110.txt
C:EmuV0 >RESULTS:M-control-110-out.txt RAM:ev/asciitable/asciitable
Echo "== emulator returned $RC" >>RESULTS:M-control-110.txt
